  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, when you hit a creature with an improvised weapon attack, you can choose to destroy the weapon to deal devastating damage. You add double your ability modifier to the damage roll (instead of the normal modifier). The improvised weapon is destroyed after the attack.</p>\n<p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a short or long rest.</p>",
